Scope of this licence
=====================

The MIT terms below cover the *software* in this repository and the results it
generates: everything under code/, scripts/, results/ and paper/figures/, and
the generated LaTeX fragments under paper/generated/.

They do not cover the manuscript. The text of the paper -- paper/main.tex,
paper/sections/, paper/preamble.tex, paper/macros.tex and the compiled
paper/build/main.pdf -- remains (c) 2026 David Alexander Astudillo Munoz, all
rights reserved, pending the licence terms of the venue where it is published.
It is included here so that the archived code can be matched to the exact
version of the paper whose numbers it produces.

No observational data are redistributed. The data sets the pipeline downloads
remain under the terms set by the collaborations that published them; only
their checksums are recorded here.

